# C2 gate walk (tools/check_fixture_equivalence.sh, inc-10v7f): an Elf monk,
# race and class chosen by name with @choose, every other screen answered with
# the first entry by the shared creation tail (tools/creation_walks_lib.sh),
# SAVED at the end of creation with nothing played. The Elf monk's kit ring
# "Brass and Glass" is put on while the gear is granted; that runs
# Magic::CalcEffect, whose 2d8 damage roll is the decision key effect_roll
# (R2, bead inc-10v7f). No other gate walk reaches it.
